# E100 · The Museum of the Last Second

[Essay catalogue](../README.md) · [Original manuscript](original.md) · [English translation](translation.en.md)

## How this essay was made

One of five philosophical thought experiments written through unusual fictional worlds. The original language is Russian. The texts were completed through a bounded later continuation with criticism and revision; the repository’s English translation was added afterward for readers and was not evaluated at midterm.

Campaign: `phantasm5-20260912-01a0944c` · Lineage: `essay-04`. The midterm ID is a blinded corpus label, not a rank.

**Original language: Russian.** The original file is preserved byte for byte. The English translation is a later reading edition. Earlier Russian manuscript versions belong to the same preserved lineage.

Recorded model observations: `gpt-6-astra`, `gpt-6-astra / high`, `gpt-6-astra / low`. These identify recorded configurations, not independent backend attestation.

